WEBVTT

01:29.030 --> 01:30.150
KNOW

01:33.240 --> 01:37.450
The seventh month of 1600 AD, or Keicho 5.

01:37.830 --> 01:41.620
Charging Tokugawa Ieyasu with
thirteen articles of impeachment,

01:41.620 --> 01:48.550
Ishida Mitsunari sent messengers to various
daimyo in the name of the Toyotomi clan,

01:48.550 --> 01:51.720
telling them to raise armies.

01:51.720 --> 01:56.800
At the same time, beings seeking
to end the period of turbulence

01:56.800 --> 02:00.680
and build a kingdom to last a thousand years

02:00.680 --> 02:04.940
were about to awaken from a thousand-year sleep.

02:04.940 --> 02:06.940
And then...

02:06.940 --> 02:10.400
On the fifteenth day of the
ninth month, at Sekigahara,

02:10.400 --> 02:13.150
the Eastern Army of
Tokugawa Ieyasu clashed with

02:13.150 --> 02:18.280
the Western Army of the Toyotomi
clan and Ishida Mitsunari.

02:18.280 --> 02:21.750
As a result of the performance of
Kobayakawa Hideaki's troops,

02:21.750 --> 02:27.670
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and
Ishida Mitsunari achieved a sweeping victory,

02:27.670 --> 02:33.930
bringing what should have been three
hundred years of peace to the world.

02:34.760 --> 02:39.810
You should all be quite familiar with this story...

02:46.370 --> 02:50.280
REST DAY

03:04.000 --> 03:05.200
What's with you?

03:06.080 --> 03:07.640
How do I put it...

03:07.800 --> 03:13.080
I was thinking to myself that all
we've done so far makes no sense.

03:13.240 --> 03:16.150
And that's why you feel down?

03:16.560 --> 03:18.120
Exactly.

03:18.760 --> 03:21.070
Is it because of your fight with Ryogen?

03:21.280 --> 03:22.550
No doubt.

03:24.080 --> 03:25.510
That's not not like you.

03:26.960 --> 03:28.670
That's what I was telling myself.

03:29.040 --> 03:31.430
In fact, I'm also down in the dumps.

03:32.640 --> 03:34.200
You too?

03:35.160 --> 03:41.400
Now that Yasha is gone I have a feeling
that our journey no longer makes sense.

03:41.560 --> 03:42.760
I understand.

03:43.560 --> 03:46.840
Even if we do not gather
the seven artifacts...

03:47.160 --> 03:51.360
Ryogen is no longer a danger
and Yasha is no longer around...

03:51.520 --> 03:54.990
to give orders to the ayakashi.

03:55.520 --> 03:56.720
Yes.

03:57.960 --> 04:00.320
It's a pain in the ass.

04:00.800 --> 04:02.000
Do you want to give up?

04:04.160 --> 04:05.390
Wanna keep going?

04:05.560 --> 04:08.030
I'm not sure myself!

04:11.000 --> 04:16.710
Master Danjo, what will the ayakashi who
wanted to kidnap Princess Kaguya do now?

04:17.200 --> 04:19.190
They won't do anything anymore.

04:19.360 --> 04:23.670
And I'm going soft as a bodyguard.

04:24.080 --> 04:28.630
It's true that the ayakashi
targeted Kaguya at first.

04:28.840 --> 04:32.120
In fact, after becoming an ayakashi...

04:32.280 --> 04:36.720
leyasu Tokugawa aka Ryogen
wanted to marry Kaguya...

04:36.880 --> 04:40.640
to establish his own shogunate.

04:41.000 --> 04:45.680
So it was like that.
I was thinking about that.

04:45.920 --> 04:50.390
Why would marrying Kaguya
give him absolute power?

04:50.600 --> 04:54.200
Princess Kaguya possesses a strange power.

04:54.360 --> 05:01.160
Ryogen and Yasha probably wanted to
use it to establish their dominance.

05:02.840 --> 05:04.350
I am not convinced!

05:04.800 --> 05:06.280
No?

05:08.760 --> 05:15.160
There is some truth to that, but are
you hiding something from us, Danjo?

05:15.320 --> 05:16.520
Erm...

05:17.000 --> 05:19.670
But no, I'm not hiding anything!

05:20.080 --> 05:23.720
- Something doesn't smell right...
- What are you saying?

05:23.880 --> 05:26.160
You don't know how to lie.

05:26.720 --> 05:31.160
I agree. You can tell by
your face and attitude.

05:31.360 --> 05:35.360
That's absolutely not true...

05:37.880 --> 05:40.270
Talk, it will do you some good.

05:40.840 --> 05:42.590
Talk? About what?

05:42.760 --> 05:44.590
Princess Kaguya's secret.

05:45.680 --> 05:47.240
I would like to know.

05:47.440 --> 05:50.670
I'll patrol the area.

05:50.840 --> 05:52.070
If you'll excuse me!

05:53.560 --> 05:57.230
- He's running away!
- He clearly knows something!

05:57.400 --> 06:00.000
- Yes.
- However...

06:00.160 --> 06:03.390
What could Princess Kaguya be hiding?

06:03.760 --> 06:07.150
- I'd really like to know...
- Yes.

06:07.640 --> 06:12.910
- It's unfair to pry into a friend's secrets.
- Yes.

06:12.920 --> 06:18.310
Perhaps it would be better to
continue respecting her secrets.

06:18.480 --> 06:19.680
Yes.

06:20.120 --> 06:21.320
What?

06:21.520 --> 06:27.120
Recently, you've been
using Ronin's favorite line.

06:27.560 --> 06:29.070
Really?

06:29.640 --> 06:33.080
You don't happen to
have a soft spot for Ronin?

06:33.520 --> 06:35.320
Don't talk nonsense!

06:46.560 --> 06:49.600
It's going to be a full
moon soon, Princess Kaguya.

06:50.120 --> 06:51.350
Indeed.

06:51.720 --> 06:54.550
Have the ayakashi stopped chasing us?

06:55.480 --> 06:56.750
I don't know.

06:57.360 --> 07:00.510
Maybe they have and maybe they haven't.

07:03.880 --> 07:06.760
But everyone is on our side now.

07:06.920 --> 07:08.750
Master Musashi...

07:08.920 --> 07:10.120
Master Ronin...

07:10.240 --> 07:11.800
Master Sasuke Sarutobi...

07:11.960 --> 07:13.520
Desperado.

07:13.680 --> 07:15.480
With them, we have nothing to fear.

07:16.360 --> 07:18.950
You forgot Danjo, he will be angry.

07:19.640 --> 07:20.840
That's true.

07:21.160 --> 07:26.510
Princess Kaguya, recently,
memories of the past came back to me.

07:27.080 --> 07:28.480
Really?

07:43.240 --> 07:49.030
Someone often sang this
song to me when I was little.

07:49.560 --> 07:52.000
Isn't that right, Princess Kaguya?

07:54.440 --> 07:57.030
I don't know who it was.

07:57.560 --> 08:04.270
Even if I close my eyes and concentrate,
I can't remember that person

08:04.520 --> 08:05.950
Nor the words to the song.

08:06.160 --> 08:09.870
THE MOON FLOATS

08:10.120 --> 08:13.400
IN THE DARK SKY

08:14.080 --> 08:20.430
SHROUDING MY BELOVED CREATIONS

08:22.080 --> 08:23.910
I HEAR THE SONG

08:24.120 --> 08:29.750
OF THE CELESTIAL CRANES

08:30.160 --> 08:33.920
LET US RETURN,
LET US RETURN

08:34.080 --> 08:38.150
THERE WHERE THEY SING

08:39.040 --> 08:44.880
FULL MOON OF AUTUMN

08:47.000 --> 08:49.990
DISTANT LIGHT

08:50.160 --> 08:54.630
OF THE NATIVE LAND

08:55.000 --> 08:59.040
THAT CANNOT ILLUMINATE

08:59.200 --> 09:02.910
SUCH LASTING DARKNESS

09:03.080 --> 09:06.840
THOUGH YOU ARE SO FAR AWAY

09:07.000 --> 09:10.440
I THINK OF YOU

09:10.600 --> 09:13.800
AS I WAIT

09:14.600 --> 09:18.230
I WATCH THE EVENING CRANES

09:19.120 --> 09:24.150
WHEN WILL I SEE YOU AGAIN?

09:26.080 --> 09:29.960
THE MOON FLOATS

09:30.120 --> 09:33.910
IN THE DARK SKY

09:34.080 --> 09:39.760
SHROUDING MY BELOVED CREATIONS

09:42.080 --> 09:45.680
I HEAR THE SONG

09:46.080 --> 09:49.870
OF THE CELESTIAL CRANES

09:50.040 --> 09:51.680
LET US RETURN...

09:52.160 --> 09:54.630
Princess Kaguya, how do you know her?

09:55.080 --> 09:57.590
She's our mother who used
to sing this song to us.

09:58.240 --> 10:00.310
Our mother?

10:00.760 --> 10:02.560
It's our mother's song.

10:04.960 --> 10:07.000
Our mother...

10:11.480 --> 10:12.680
Ruko...

10:14.640 --> 10:18.840
I remember.
Our mom used to hold me in her arms...

10:20.480 --> 10:22.710
...and would sing to me.

10:23.120 --> 10:26.800
THE MOON FLOATS

10:26.960 --> 10:30.750
