13:07.880 --> 13:11.400
SUCH LASTING DARKNESS

13:11.960 --> 13:15.720
THOUGH YOU ARE SO FAR AWAY

13:13.040 --> 13:15.510
Kaguya, Yume...

13:15.880 --> 13:19.270
I THINK OF YOU

13:16.960 --> 13:18.280
That song...

13:19.480 --> 13:22.880
AS I WAIT

13:41.240 --> 13:43.550
Damn Yasha!

13:43.760 --> 13:45.560
Exactly!

13:45.960 --> 13:48.520
I hate the ayakashi!

13:48.920 --> 13:52.470
Let it out!
Shout louder!

13:52.960 --> 13:56.430
They gave me this body!

13:56.600 --> 14:00.480
It was Yasha, who forsake the pound cake!

14:01.600 --> 14:05.430
Oh, a joke that won't be
funny even in 300 years!

14:06.040 --> 14:10.430
Sorry, I had to rhyme.

14:10.600 --> 14:13.670
Come on, one more round!

14:13.840 --> 14:15.400
Tell me, Dabi-dabi!

14:15.880 --> 14:17.360
Dabi-dabi?

14:17.560 --> 14:19.440
You're pretty lucky.

14:19.600 --> 14:21.400
What do you mean?

14:21.560 --> 14:26.880
Even though you've been dead for a hundred years, you're still known as a genius...

14:27.040 --> 14:31.350
and you got resurrected and
can continue inventing quietly!

14:31.560 --> 14:34.870
But what are you saying?
You would have...

14:35.040 --> 14:39.430
died of stomach cancer,
but because you are an ayakashi...

14:39.600 --> 14:43.310
you can live much longer.

14:43.520 --> 14:47.310
Live much longer?
What's the point with this body?

14:47.640 --> 14:50.280
Do you really hate this ayakashi body?

14:50.880 --> 14:53.760
Well yes, I can't get used to it.

14:55.960 --> 14:59.240
Do you also find my body ugly?

14:59.480 --> 15:00.910
Well...

15:01.080 --> 15:04.710
I'm starting to get used to it
and become attached to it.

15:05.080 --> 15:07.670
You are kinder than I thought.

15:09.560 --> 15:11.680
Words don't cost anything.

15:12.080 --> 15:15.120
Then do you really think it's ugly?

15:15.680 --> 15:22.120
I think no one in this world would
think that body is beautiful.

15:22.560 --> 15:24.070
You finally said it.

15:24.520 --> 15:28.880
I'm sorry but my aesthetic
sense is the best in the world.

15:29.400 --> 15:34.910
That's right, you are the one who
painted that famous Molimana!

15:35.080 --> 15:37.040
How beautiful she was!

15:37.560 --> 15:40.470
She was a beautiful
woman named Gioconda.

15:40.920 --> 15:43.990
But the real one is not as
beautiful as the painting.

15:44.760 --> 15:49.960
By the way, it was Mona Lisa, not Molimana.

15:50.160 --> 15:53.440
I know, just kidding!

15:53.600 --> 15:55.960
Phew, I'm really ugly.

15:56.160 --> 16:01.920
You can't do anything about it, but in
return, you got the power of the ayakashi.

16:02.440 --> 16:04.880
I don't need this power!

16:07.080 --> 16:11.600
I feel that life has become ridiculous....

16:13.680 --> 16:17.070
How young you are!

16:17.280 --> 16:20.080
It should not have been like this!

16:21.520 --> 16:24.030
Come on, have another drink!

16:24.200 --> 16:27.430
Drink and you will forget all the worries!

16:32.360 --> 16:35.240
That's life!
Life is like that!

16:35.400 --> 16:37.990
Drink, drink, drink!

16:38.200 --> 16:40.950
Yes, yes and yes!

16:41.720 --> 16:45.030
Drink, drink, drink!

16:45.360 --> 16:50.400
Drinking too much is bad for your health,
but Ryogen is an ayakashi, so he can do it.

16:50.560 --> 16:53.920
Do not attempt this at home.

16:54.480 --> 16:58.920
One more round!
That's life! Life is like that!

16:59.560 --> 17:01.870
Drink, drink, drink!

17:05.400 --> 17:07.790
Yes, yes and yes.

17:08.880 --> 17:11.790
Drink, drink, drink!

17:14.920 --> 17:17.750
Good, now I'm going to dance!

17:18.120 --> 17:21.640
Perfect!
On the dance floor!

17:21.800 --> 17:27.390
I, leyasu Tokugawa aka Ryogen, will perform my special Fox Dance!

17:27.560 --> 17:29.520
Come on!

17:42.120 --> 17:45.800
THE MOON FLOATS

17:45.960 --> 17:49.750
IN THE DARK SKY

17:49.920 --> 17:56.030
SHROUDING MY BELOVED CREATIONS

17:57.920 --> 18:01.800
I HEAR THE SONG

18:01.960 --> 18:05.790
OF THE CELESTIAL CRANES

18:05.960 --> 18:09.790
LET US RETURN,
LET US RETURN

18:09.960 --> 18:13.790
THERE WHERE THEY SING

18:15.000 --> 18:20.950
FULL MOON OF AUTUMN

18:22.920 --> 18:25.800
DISTANT LIGHT

18:25.960 --> 18:30.720
OF THE NATIVE LAND

18:30.880 --> 18:34.270
THAT CANNOT ILLUMINATE

18:34.960 --> 18:38.400
SUCH LASTING DARKNESS

18:38.960 --> 18:42.720
THOUGH YOU ARE SO FAR AWAY

18:42.880 --> 18:46.270
I THINK OF YOU

18:46.480 --> 18:50.270
AS I WAIT

18:50.440 --> 18:54.270
I WATCH THE EVENING CRANES

18:55.000 --> 19:00.360
WHEN WILL I SEE YOU AGAIN?

19:01.920 --> 19:05.800
THE MOON FLOATS

19:05.960 --> 19:09.750
IN THE DARK SKY

19:09.960 --> 19:15.880
SHROUDING MY BELOVED CREATIONS

19:10.280 --> 19:11.710
What a beautiful song.

19:11.880 --> 19:13.390
Truly beautiful.

19:13.560 --> 19:15.550
Princess Kaguya, Princess Yume...

19:17.960 --> 19:21.790
I HEAR THE SONG

19:21.960 --> 19:25.790
OF THE CELESTIAL CRANES

19:24.080 --> 19:26.550
- What a sad song.
- Yes.

19:25.960 --> 19:29.790
LET US RETURN,
LET US RETURN

19:26.920 --> 19:31.520
At the same time, it calms me, relaxes me.

19:29.960 --> 19:32.920
LET US RETURN

19:32.120 --> 19:33.320
Yes.

19:34.040 --> 19:37.800
THE MOON FLOATS

19:37.960 --> 19:41.840
IN THE DARK SKY

19:39.160 --> 19:42.280
Stop singing this song!

19:42.000 --> 19:46.680
SHROUDING MY BELOVED CREATIONS

19:42.840 --> 19:46.440
Stop singing!

19:49.920 --> 19:53.800
I HEAR THE SONG

19:53.960 --> 19:55.890
OF THE CELESTIAL-

19:59.440 --> 20:00.760
Urashima!

20:00.960 --> 20:03.240
Stop singing!

20:08.840 --> 20:10.040
Yume!

20:16.000 --> 20:17.640
Yume! Kaguya!

20:18.000 --> 20:19.510
It's Urashima!

20:19.720 --> 20:24.000
Why is Urashima attacking them?

20:24.320 --> 20:26.910
He's supposed to be on our side!

20:27.080 --> 20:28.990
What does that mean?

20:37.280 --> 20:38.840
Urashima, what are you doing?

20:39.200 --> 20:42.800
I don't want to hear that song again!

20:43.240 --> 20:47.280
Why? It's our mother's song!

20:47.480 --> 20:49.630
I told you to stop singing!

20:52.680 --> 20:54.080
Explosive bullet!

21:19.080 --> 21:23.550
Master Musashi, we will protect
Princess Kaguya and Princess Yume!

21:23.960 --> 21:25.160
Yes.

21:25.720 --> 21:31.960
Thank you. So, Urashima,
will you explain yourself?

21:32.400 --> 21:34.280
It's useless to give explanations.

21:34.440 --> 21:37.960
I just don't want them to sing that song.

21:38.400 --> 21:40.680
What if they disobey?

21:40.840 --> 21:43.910
Will you kill Kaguya and Yume?

21:46.080 --> 21:48.880
It would be better to explain why.

22:10.320 --> 22:13.760
Forgive me, I'm leaving.

22:13.920 --> 22:15.590
Wait a minute!

22:16.480 --> 22:18.040
Explain yourself!

22:18.240 --> 22:19.960
It's useless.

22:21.720 --> 22:23.040
Urashima...

22:23.640 --> 22:28.000
Kaguya, is Urashima, by any chance...?

22:28.440 --> 22:30.880
But he's a different person now.

22:31.040 --> 22:32.310
A different person?

22:32.480 --> 22:39.600
But I'm sure that, one day, Urashima will
go back to being the person he was.

22:39.760 --> 22:40.990
Kaguya...

22:41.840 --> 22:45.960
I didn't quite understand,
but you should keep singing.

22:48.360 --> 22:50.400
After all, it's a good song.

22:50.600 --> 22:52.350
Yes.

22:52.520 --> 22:53.920
Don't copy me!

22:54.080 --> 22:55.880
Why not, you cheapskate!

22:56.400 --> 23:00.030
I'm not cheap, that's my favorite line!

23:00.400 --> 23:02.120
You're being cheap!

23:02.280 --> 23:03.480
Say that again!

23:03.520 --> 23:04.720
Say what again?

23:04.840 --> 23:08.120
In a way, you two are a good match.

23:08.280 --> 23:10.320
What are you talking about?

23:10.800 --> 23:12.310
Eh, Sasuke!

23:13.640 --> 23:16.760
How long have you had
this kind of relationship?

23:17.280 --> 23:19.750
Master Ronin and Desperado?

23:19.920 --> 23:21.750
- I didn't see that coming!
- Yes.

23:22.320 --> 23:23.520
Yes.

23:23.600 --> 23:24.800
Yes.

23:24.880 --> 23:27.680
Stop getting involved in this!

23:28.360 --> 23:30.640
Don't blush, come on!

23:30.800 --> 23:33.160
You're a nice couple!

23:33.320 --> 23:35.630
- There is nothing between us!
- Yes!

23:36.200 --> 23:38.590
That's right, you make a cute couple!

23:38.800 --> 23:41.080
You too, Musashi?
You're a pain in the ass...

23:48.200 --> 23:50.430
Kaguya, Yume...

23:51.800 --> 23:54.950
Who are they?

25:31.760 --> 25:34.350
Rasetsu is still attacking us?

25:34.520 --> 25:36.720
Something is wrong!

25:37.280 --> 25:39.190
He's doing what with brushes?

25:40.000 --> 25:43.710
The next chapter: <i>Rasetsu's Last Stand</i>
